@ConfigService = http://localhost:5081

### Resolve a seeded zone
GET {{ConfigService}}/zones?carrierServiceType=GROUND&originPostcode=94105&destinationPostcode=10001&originCountry=US&destinationCountry=US
Accept: application/json

### Retrieve the matching dimensional rate
GET {{ConfigService}}/rates?carrierServiceType=GROUND&zone=US-WEST-TO-NORTHEAST&weight=2.5&length=30&height=20&width=20
Accept: application/json

### Zone-not-found case
GET {{ConfigService}}/zones?carrierServiceType=GROUND&originPostcode=94105&destinationPostcode=30301&originCountry=US&destinationCountry=US
Accept: application/json

### Rate-not-found case: dimensions exceed the configured limit
GET {{ConfigService}}/rates?carrierServiceType=GROUND&zone=US-WEST-TO-NORTHEAST&weight=2.5&length=150&height=20&width=20
Accept: application/json
